    title: "cuda: file-scope calls and member / qualified / template callees emit no edge (pytorch: 1,223 file-scope sites; 26,903 in-definition sites vs 17,695 edges) -- residual of WI-fohuh"  # 8177
    status: todo_hard  # 8177
