  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e on a .cu fixture: ps->f() and s.f() DO emit a calls edge (cuda.py:369-377 field_expression fallback, present since Jan though marked pragma no cover, binds by bare name); ns::helper(), tf<int>() and a file-scope static init g(3) emit nothing. Remaining scope: qualified + template callees and file-scope calls; member calls are not part of the gap. MECHANISM: callee reader accepts identifier/field_identifier only, not qualified_identifier/template_function; file-scope calls get top_level=None. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gufip."  # 4551
